        "title": "国会议员简历底稿（2026年6月整理，仓库归档）",
        "published_at": "2026-06-13",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-22",
        "excerpt": "约翰·穆勒纳尔，男，1961年5月生，密歇根州米德兰市人，研究生学历，公共管理硕士学位，1997年6月参加工作，1997年11月加入美国共和党。",
        "tier": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "cdir1",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/app/details/CDIR-2026-02-20",
        "title": "Official Congressional Directory, 119th Congress（2026年2月20日版，美国政府出版局）",
        "published_at": "2026-02-20",
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "JOHN R. MOOLENAAR, Republican, of Caledonia, MI; born in Midland, MI, May 8, 1961; education: B.S., Hope College, Holland, MI, 1983; M.P.A., Harvard University, Cambridge, MA, 1989; professional history: chemist, Dow Chemical Company; businessman; school administrator; member, Midland City Council, 1997-2000; member, Michigan House of Representatives, 2003-08; member, Michigan State Senate, 2011-14; election history: elected to the 4th District for the 114th Congress on November 4, 2014; reelected to each succeeding Congress; elected to the 2nd District for the 118th Congress on November 8, 2022; reelected to the 119th Congress on November 5, 2024.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "url": "https://moolenaar.house.gov/about/full-biography",
        "title": "约翰·穆勒纳尔众议员官网：Biography",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "He began his career as a chemist, after graduating from Hope College with a bachelor’s degree in chemistry. Moolenaar then worked in business development, and as a school administrator. Moolenaar has a master’s degree in public administration from Harvard University. From 2003-2008, he served in the Michigan House of Representatives, and in the Michigan State Senate from 2011-2014. ... Moolenaar also serves as Chairman of the House Select Committee on the Strategic Competition Between the United States and the Chinese Communist Party.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "url": "https://webharvest.gov/congress114th/20170111234646/https://moolenaar.house.gov/about/full-biography",
        "title": "约翰·穆勒纳尔众议员官网简历（2017年1月，美国国家档案馆第114届国会网页存档）",
        "published_at": "2017-01-11",
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "He has worked as a chemist and business development director, and as an administrator at Midland Academy of Advanced and Creative Studies.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Moolenaar",
        "title": "维基百科：John Moolenaar",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "Member of the Michigan House of Representatives from the 98th district, in office January 1, 2003 – December 31, 2008; Member of the Michigan Senate from the 36th district, in office January 1, 2011 – December 31, 2014; Chair of the House Committee on the Chinese Communist Party, assumed office April 24, 2024. ... Moolenaar worked at Dow Chemical Company as a chemist for eight months before entering politics.",
        "tier": 3
      }
